From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 17:38:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: rockchip: add Ulanzi D200

The Ulanzi D200 is a stream controller built around an RK3308B-S, with
a grid of keys in front of a 720x1280 LCD.

Signed-off-by: Chris Blake <chrisrblake93@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml
index 1a9dde186..e679ba54f 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml
@@ -1306,6 +1306,11 @@ properties:
           - const: turing,rk1
           - const: rockchip,rk3588
 
+      - description: Ulanzi D200 stream controller
+        items:
+          - const: ulanzi,d200
+          - const: rockchip,rk3308
+
       - description: WolfVision PF5 mainboard
         items:
           - const: wolfvision,rk3568-pf5
